      "source_excerpt": "protocolSection.descriptionModule.detailedDescription and protocolSection.outcomesModule.primaryOutcomes: \"This trial consists of 3 different periods:\" \", which is randomized and double-blind, during which 2/3 participants will receive remibrutinib and 1/3 will receive placebo for 24 weeks.\" \"Total duration: approximately 32 weeks (10 site visits).\" \"open-label extension (OLE) period\" \"proposed to all participants who completed 24 weeks of treatment of the\" \"Depending on their CSU symptoms (as assessed by the doctor), participants will either receive remibrutinib for 24 weeks, or enter an observational treatment-free period for 1 year.\" \"At the end of the 24-week treatment period, if CSU is controlled, participants will enter the 1-year observational period, otherwise, they can continue with another cycle of 24-week remibrutinib treatment.\" \"The number of remibrutinib treatment or observational cycles will be limited to 6 times each.\" \"Total duration: from 1 year to approximately 3 years, and number of visits: from 3 to 15 (depending on the CSU symptoms).\" \"long-term treatment-free follow-up period\" \"No treatment will be given.\" \"Duration: 3 years with 1 site visit and up to 4 phone call follow-up visits.\" \"The primary clinical question of interest is what is the effect of remibrutinib treatment versus placebo on the change from baseline in UAS7, ISS7 and HSS7 scores after 12 weeks of treatment\" -- Core randomized double-blind treatment is 24 weeks; the primary clinical question assesses outcomes after 12 weeks of treatment. Optional OLE allows up to six 24-week treatment or one-year observation cycles (maximum six of each); registry states OLE total duration from 1 year to approximately 3 years. The separate optional treatment-free follow-up is 3 years, with one site visit and up to four phone follow-up visits. CT.gov narrative contains no full per-visit schedule table, so full_visit_table_available=false. No unstated visit dates or conversions from years to weeks are supplied.",
